      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Botanic Interruption",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "interaction",
      "traits": [
        "primal"
      ],
      "text": "Trigger The taiga yai is standing in natural foliage or undergrowth and is targeted by a melee attack\n\n---\n\nEffect The taiga yai infuses their power within the plants around them, causing the plants to shoot up and create a protective barrier. The taiga yai gains a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack roll. If the attack misses, the attacker must attempt a DC 33 Reflex save save. On a failed save, the attacker is Immobilized for 1 round as the plants grab hold of them; on a critical failure, the attacker is also knocked Prone.",
      "rules": [
